{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Just Run&quot; is a very simple game, with simple movement, simple jumping, simple background, and a 2D platform game composed of many simple elements. You will play a white pattern creature, breaking through the preset map, with only the functions of jumping and moving, and interacting with the derived scene props, avoiding dangerous objects on the scene, picking up points and reaching the destination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you have collected all the points and come to the point, you will see new changes in the scene and generate new routes. You will once again adventure on the new route. Jumping and moving are the skills you can rely on most.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will see the essence of the four seasons on the map, an abstract representation of seasonal changes, and it seems that some scenes and props on the map will change accordingly? The cycle of the four seasons turns, with the end connected to the beginning.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game content</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game duration is about 1 hour</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 chapters in total</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 background music</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Spring","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3764230/9234119ba02908edeabb0cf4c3fed130ee3e0ad6.jpg"},{"name":"Summer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3764230/65eb5868a3523aff4755d86223dc9f5a76e88949.jpg"},{"name":"Autumn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3764230/33951777adc895cbb0d01deaf42e5a6fa86394af.jpg"},{"name":"Winter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3764230/562004b99f56c2f399498172be0b9489534ac33d.jpg"}],"total":4},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepage